TreasurePots is a play-money slot game with a distinct Emerald Vault design,
an emerald-themed symbol set, three fixed-value savings pots, colorful linked-value
chips, and a player-spun weighted jackpot bonus wheel.

Current feature rules:
- Savings banks advance only after paid-spin LINK wins. Pocket Pot, Lucky Pot, and
  Royal Pot respectively have 72%, 48%, and 28% chances to gain 2-6% per
  qualifying LINK win. They open only at 100% and award $5, $25, and $100.
- Emerald Vault jackpots use a $0.50 base wager with guaranteed minimums of
  Mini $250, Minor $1,000, Major $5,000, and Grand $25,000. Above a $0.50
  total bet, every tier scales upward in direct proportion to the wager.
- The TreasurePots wheel awards regular coin prizes 90% of the time: Copper
  Coin 1x bet (35%), Lucky Coin 2x (25%), Ruby Coin 5x (18%), or Golden
  Coin 10x (12%). Jackpot outcomes total 10%: Mini 7%, Minor 2%, Major
  0.8%, and Grand 0.2%.
- The wheel opens when 3, 4, or 5 Emerald Wheel trigger chips land from the
  left on an active payline.
- Settings include separate controls for winning LINK-chain frequency and
  non-paying Not Connected LINK display frequency. Defaults are 28% of
  eligible winning spins and 9% of spins without a winning LINK.
- Reel Jackpot Odds settings apply only to jackpots appearing directly on the
  reels and do not change the bonus-wheel probabilities.

NO REAL MONEY.
